maintained residential building with an elevator at Seestraße 165, 25469 Halstenbek.\n\nThe room is part of a shared apartment (WG) with one other person and is ideal for professionals, commuters, or students.\n\nRoom Amenities:\n\nSingle bed\nWardrobe\nDesk\nChair\nCoffee table\n\nRent:\n€800 all-inclusive\nThe rent is a fully inclusive price, meaning no additional costs apply.\n\nIncluded in the rent:\n\nHeating\nElectricity\nInternet\n\nPrime Location:\nThe apartment is located less than a 1-minute walk from S-Bahn station Krupunder. The S3 line provides fast connections to Hamburg and surrounding areas.\n\nTravel times by S-Bahn from Krupunder:\n\nAltona: approx. 16 minutes\nReeperbahn: approx. 20 minutes\nHamburg Dammtor / University of Hamburg: approx. 24 minutes\nJungfernstieg: approx. 26 minutes\nHamburg Central Station (Hauptbahnhof): approx. 28 minutes\nHarburg: approx. 45 minutes\n\nEverything you need nearby:\n\nS-Bahn Krupunder: less than 1 minute walk\nEDEKA Töpfert (Seestraße 161a): approx. 1 minute walk\nBäcker Schlüter (Seestraße 161): approx. 1 minute walk\nSee-Apotheke (Seestraße 252): approx. 2–3 minutes walk\n\n\nDeutsch\nZur Vermietung steht ein 14 m2 großes, möbliertes Zimmer in einer 2-Zimmer-Wohnung im 5. Stock eines gepflegten Wohnhauses mit Fahrstuhl in der Seestraße 165, 25469 Halstenbek. Das Zimmer befindet sich in einer WG mit einer weiteren Person und eignet sich ideal für Berufstätige, Pendler oder Studierende.\n\nAusstattung des Zimmers:\n\nEinzelbett\nKleiderschrank\nSchreibtisch\nStuhl\nCouchtisch\n\nMiete:\n800 € warm\nDie Miete ist eine Inklusivmiete, in der alles enthalten ist. Es entstehen keine zusätzlichen Kosten.\n\nIn der Miete enthalten sind bereits:\n\nHeizkosten\nStrom\nInternet\n\nTop-Lage:\nDie Wohnung liegt unter einer Minute zu Fuß von der S-Bahn Krupunder entfernt. Die Linie S3 verbindet den Standort schnell mit Hamburg und der Umgebung.\n\nFahrzeiten mit der S-Bahn ab Krupunder:\n\nAltona: ca. 16 Minuten\nReeperbahn: ca. 20 Minuten\nHamburg Dammtor / Uni Hamburg: ca. 24 Minuten\nJungfernstieg: ca. 26 Minuten\nHamburg Hauptbahnhof: ca. 28 Minuten\nHarburg: ca. 45 Minuten\n\nAlles Wichtige direkt in der Nähe:\n\nS-Bahn Krupunder: unter 1 Minute zu Fuß\nEDEKA Töpfert, Seestraße 161a: ca. 1 Minute zu Fuß\nBäcker Schlüter, Seestraße 161: ca. 1 Minute zu Fuß\nSee-Apotheke, Seestraße 252: ca. 2–3 Minuten zu Fuß","facilities":{"airConditioning":{"value":"no"},"allergyFriendly":{"value":"no"},"balconyTerrace":{"value":"no"},"basement":{"value":"no"},"bathroom":{"value":"shared_w_both"},"bed":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomFurnished":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomLock":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomSize":{"value":"14"},"bedrooms":{"value":"1"},"closet":{"value":"yes"},"couplesAllowed":{"value":"no"},"desk":{"value":"yes"},"dishwasher":{"value":"no"},"dryer":{"value":"no"},"electricityCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"flooring":{"value":"laminate"},"garden":{"value":"no"},"gasCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"heating":{"value":"central"},"housematesGender":{"value":"shared_w_both"},"internetCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"kitchen":{"value":"shared"},"kitchenware":{"value":"shared"},"livingRoom":{"value":"no"},"parking":{"value":"shared"},"pets":{"value":"no"},"playMusic":{"value":"no"},"registrationPossible":{"value":"yes"},"roomFurniture":{"value":"no"},"smoking":{"value":"no"},"toilet":{"value":"shared"},"totalSize":{"value":"56"},"tv":{"value":"no"},"washingMachine":{"value":"yes"},"waterCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"wheelchairAccessible":{"value":"no"},"wifi":{"value":"yes"}},"costs":{"currency":"EUR","pricing":"monthly","price":80000,"deposit":220000,"agencyFee":0,"estimatedBills":0},"costsFormatted":{"currency":"EUR","pricing":"monthly","price":"800.00","deposit":"2200.00","agencyFee":"0.00","estimatedBills":"0.00"},"minimumStayMonths":6,"moveInWindow":0,"currentOccupancy":1,"minAge":0,"maxAge":29,"preferredGender":"","available":[{"to":"9999-12-31","from":"2026-07-01"}],"updated":"2026-04-06T19:47:57Z","